    "{\"scene\": \"The city drifts above a sea of ochre sand, structures of blown, iridescent glass clinging to massive, slow-moving buoyancy platforms. Harsh, bleached sunlight refracts through crystalline spires and colossal, dormant steam vents.\", \"look\": \"Golden hour\", \"cast\": \"Slender build, early twenties, sharp cheekbones framed by dark, tightly braided hair. He wears a tunic of deep indigo linen cinched with a leather sash. He clutches a delicate, glowing crucible.\", \"continuity\": \"Thin build, indigo linen, dark braids, glowing crucible\", \"shots\": [{\"index\": 1, \"action\": \"Close on his hands turning the glowing lens; light fractures into rainbows across his face.\", \"start_frame\": \"The lead holds the lens at chest height\", \"end_state\": \"The lead raises the lens to eye level\"}]}"
